  "editor_review": "Prepare for an exhilarating experience with the Scary Teacher game! In this thrilling app, you'll step into the shoes of a clever student set on teaching their most dreaded high school teacher a valuable lesson. This unsettling teacher has been causing distress among students, and now she lives next door. Your goal is to frighten her by performing various tasks and freeing her trapped pets. Investigate her 15-room house and discover the secrets hidden inside. But take caution not to be seen! Featuring simple controls, an expansive interactive environment, and horror elements that are family-friendly, this eagerly awaited game promises to keep you engaged. How long will you manage to outwit the Scary Teacher? Download the game today and see for yourself!",
